PK     ElitePay Companion Android App Placeholder
==================================================
This is a placeholder file for the ElitePay Companion Android Application (v3.2.0).

Merchants can download the live app directly from Google Play Store:
https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.qubeplug.billpax_tools

To provide a direct sideloadable APK:
Compile your Android project or place your signed 'elitepay-companion.apk' in this directory (assets/apps/elitepay-companion.apk).
It will immediately be downloaded by any user who clicks "Download Direct APK" on your ElitePay website or merchant dashboard.
